			"notes": "- Added new password management commands:\n\t- password set <password> - sets a password for a current player in a file\n\t- password generate [length] [register] - generates a random password and saves to file (add register to register as well)\n \t- password backup <filename> - creates a backup of your password file\n- Added a cooldown option to prevent rapid repeated /login commands (useful for servers with auth lobbies)\n- Added upwards compatibility. Works up to 1.21.11"
